T146	Entity 14474 14477	Jim
R182	Speaker Arg1:T143 Arg2:T145	
R183	Cueing Arg1:T144 Arg2:T145	
R184	Addressee Arg1:T146 Arg2:T145	
T147	Cue 14497 14501	said
T148	Quotation 14503 14773	"Can't, Mars Tom. Ole missis, she tole me I got to go an' git dis water an' not stop foolin' roun' wid anybody. She say she spec' Mars Tom gwine to ax me to whitewash, an' so she tole me go 'long an' 'tend to my own business-- she 'lowed SHE'D 'tend to de whitewashin'."
R185	Cueing Arg1:T147 Arg2:T148	
R186	Speaker Arg1:T146 Arg2:T148	
R187	Addressee Arg1:T143 Arg2:T148	
T149	Quotation 14774 14921	"Oh, never you mind what she said, Jim. That's the way she always talks. Gimme the bucket -- I won't be gone only a a minute. SHE won't ever know."
R188	Addressee Arg1:T146 Arg2:T149	
R189	Speaker Arg1:T143 Arg2:T149	
T150	Quotation 14922 15012	"Oh, I dasn't, Mars Tom. Ole missis she'd take an' tar de head off'n me. 'Deed she would."
R190	Speaker Arg1:T146 Arg2:T150	
R191	Addressee Arg1:T143 Arg2:T150	
T151	Quotation 15013 15263	"SHE! She never licks anybody-- whacks 'em over the head with her thimble-- and who cares for that, I'd like to know. She talks awful, but talk don't hurt-- anyways it don't if she don't cry. Jim, I'll give you a marvel. I'll give you a white alley!"
R192	Addressee Arg1:T146 Arg2:T151	
