R230	Addressee Arg1:T187 Arg2:T186	
T188	Quotation 19815 20210	"No-- no -- I reckon it wouldn't hardly do, Ben. You see, Aunt Polly's awful particular about this fence-- right here on the street, you know --but if it was the back fence I wouldn't mind and SHE wouldn't. Yes, she's awful particular about this fence; it's got to be done very careful; I reckon there ain't one boy in a thousand, maybe two thousand, that can do it the way it's got to be done."
R231	Speaker Arg1:T187 Arg2:T188	
R232	Addressee Arg1:T184 Arg2:T188	
T189	Quotation 20211 20314	"No-- is that so? Oh come, now-- lemme just try. Only just a little-- I'd let YOU, if you was me, Tom."
