R234	Speaker Arg1:T184 Arg2:T189	
T190	Quotation 20315 20567	"Ben, I'd like to, honest injun; but Aunt Polly-- well, Jim wanted to do it, but she wouldn't let him; Sid wanted to do it, and she wouldn't let Sid. Now don't you see how I'm fixed? If you was to tackle this fence and anything was to happen to it -- "
