R299	Addressee Arg1:T229 Arg2:T241	
R300	Speaker Arg1:T227 Arg2:T241	
T242	Quotation 37142 37388	"Oh, Tom, you poor thick-headed thing, I'm not teasing you. I wouldn't do that. You must go and learn it again. Don't you be discouraged, Tom, you'll manage it-- and if you do, I'll give you something ever so nice. There, now, that's a good boy."
