R563	Addressee Arg1:T424 Arg2:T423	
T425	Quotation 78973 78989	"Thomas Sawyer!"
T426	Entity 78968 78971	him
T427	Entity 78990 78993	Tom
R564	Speaker Arg1:T426 Arg2:T425	
R565	Addressee Arg1:T427 Arg2:T425	
T428	Quotation 79060 79066	"Sir!"
R566	Speaker Arg1:T427 Arg2:T428	
R567	Addressee Arg1:T426 Arg2:T428	
T429	Quotation 79067 79126	"Come up here. Now, sir, why are you late again, as usual?"
