T433	Entity 79425 79435	The master
R572	Addressee Arg1:T433 Arg2:T432	
T434	Entity 79570 79580	The master
T435	Cue 79581 79585	said
T436	Quotation 79587 79608	"You-- you did what?"
R573	Cueing Arg1:T435 Arg2:T436	
R574	Speaker Arg1:T434 Arg2:T436	
T437	Quotation 79609 79649	"Stopped to talk with Huckleberry Finn."
T438	Entity 79532 79550	this foolhardy boy
R575	Addressee Arg1:T438 Arg2:T436	
R576	Addressee Arg1:T434 Arg2:T437	
R577	Speaker Arg1:T438 Arg2:T437	
T439	Quotation 79684 79831	"Thomas Sawyer, this is the most astounding confession I have ever listened to. No mere ferule will answer for this offence. Take off your jacket."
R578	Speaker Arg1:T434 Arg2:T439	
R579	Addressee Arg1:T438 Arg2:T439	
T440	Quotation 79949 80021	"Now, sir, go and sit with the girls! And let this be a warning to you."
T441	Entity 80080 80087	the boy
R580	Addressee Arg1:T441 Arg2:T440	
T442	Entity 79832 79842	The master
R581	Speaker Arg1:T442 Arg2:T440	
T443	Entity 81465 81468	she
T444	Cue 81494 81503	whispered
T445	Quotation 81505 81521	"Let me see it."
R582	Speaker Arg1:T443 Arg2:T445	
R583	Cueing Arg1:T444 Arg2:T445	
T446	Entity 81522 81525	Tom
R584	Addressee Arg1:T446 Arg2:T445	
T447	Entity 81767 81770	she
T448	Cue 81792 81801	whispered
T449	Quotation 81803 81828	"It's nice-- make a man."
R585	Speaker Arg1:T447 Arg2:T449	
R586	Cueing Arg1:T448 Arg2:T449	
T450	Entity 81829 81839	The artist
R587	Addressee Arg1:T450 Arg2:T449	
T451	Entity 81973 81976	she
T452	Cue 82013 82022	whispered
T453	Quotation 82024 82074	"It's a beautiful man-- now make me coming along."
R588	Speaker Arg1:T451 Arg2:T453	
R589	Cueing Arg1:T452 Arg2:T453	
T454	Entity 82075 82078	Tom
R590	Addressee Arg1:T454 Arg2:T453	
T455	Entity 82192 82200	The girl
T456	Cue 82201 82205	said
T457	Quotation 82207 82250	"It's ever so nice -- I wish I could draw."
R591	Cueing Arg1:T456 Arg2:T457	
R592	Speaker Arg1:T455 Arg2:T457	
T458	Quotation 82251 82263	"It's easy,"
T459	Cue 82264 82273	whispered
T460	Entity 82274 82277	Tom
T461	Quotation 82279 82296	"I'll learn you."
R593	Addressee Arg1:T460 Arg2:T457	
R594	Cueing Arg1:T459 Arg2:T458	
R595	Cueing Arg1:T459 Arg2:T461	
R596	Speaker Arg1:T460 Arg2:T458	
R597	Speaker Arg1:T460 Arg2:T461	
R598	Addressee Arg1:T455 Arg2:T458	
R599	Addressee Arg1:T455 Arg2:T461	
T462	Quotation 82297 82318	"Oh, will you? When?"
R600	Addressee Arg1:T460 Arg2:T462	
R601	Speaker Arg1:T455 Arg2:T462	
T463	Quotation 82319 82355	"At noon. Do you go home to dinner?"
R602	Speaker Arg1:T460 Arg2:T463	
R603	Addressee Arg1:T455 Arg2:T463	
T464	Quotation 82356 82380	"I'll stay if you will."
R604	Addressee Arg1:T460 Arg2:T464	
R605	Speaker Arg1:T455 Arg2:T464	
T465	Quotation 82381 82423	"Good-- that's a whack. What's your name?"
R606	Speaker Arg1:T460 Arg2:T465	
R607	Addressee Arg1:T455 Arg2:T465	
T466	Quotation 82424 82487	"Becky Thatcher. What's yours? Oh, I know. It's Thomas Sawyer."
R608	Addressee Arg1:T460 Arg2:T466	
R609	Speaker Arg1:T455 Arg2:T466	
T467	Quotation 82488 82572	"That's the name they lick me by. I'm Tom when I'm good. You call me Tom, will you?"
R610	Speaker Arg1:T460 Arg2:T467	
R611	Addressee Arg1:T455 Arg2:T467	
T468	Quotation 82573 82579	"Yes."
R612	Addressee Arg1:T460 Arg2:T468	
R613	Speaker Arg1:T455 Arg2:T468	
T469	Entity 82715 82718	Tom
T470	Cue 82719 82723	said
T471	Quotation 82725 82749	"Oh, it ain't anything."
R614	Cueing Arg1:T470 Arg2:T471	
R615	Speaker Arg1:T469 Arg2:T471	
T472	Entity 82696 82699	She
R616	Addressee Arg1:T472 Arg2:T471	
T473	Quotation 82750 82762	"Yes it is."
R617	Addressee Arg1:T469 Arg2:T473	
R618	Speaker Arg1:T472 Arg2:T473	
T474	Quotation 82763 82800	"No it ain't. You don't want to see."
R619	Speaker Arg1:T469 Arg2:T474	
R620	Addressee Arg1:T472 Arg2:T474	
T475	Quotation 82801 82840	"Yes I do, indeed I do. Please let me."
R621	Speaker Arg1:T472 Arg2:T475	
R622	Addressee Arg1:T469 Arg2:T475	
T476	Quotation 82841 82855	"You'll tell."
R623	Speaker Arg1:T469 Arg2:T476	
R624	Addressee Arg1:T472 Arg2:T476	
T477	Quotation 82856 82907	"No I won't-- deed and deed and double deed won't."
R625	Speaker Arg1:T472 Arg2:T477	
R626	Addressee Arg1:T469 Arg2:T477	
T478	Quotation 82908 82967	"You won't tell anybody at all? Ever, as long as you live?"
R627	Speaker Arg1:T469 Arg2:T478	
R628	Addressee Arg1:T472 Arg2:T478	
T479	Quotation 82968 83012	"No, I won't ever tell ANYbody. Now let me."
R629	Addressee Arg1:T469 Arg2:T479	
R630	Speaker Arg1:T472 Arg2:T479	
T480	Quotation 83013 83041	"Oh, YOU don't want to see!"
R631	Speaker Arg1:T469 Arg2:T480	
